			"notes": "## Changes\n- Moving, rotating and scaling displays is much smoother: edits happen on your client while you drag or scroll, and the server confirms the result once you let go\n- Rotation and scale previews no longer lag a tick behind the position, and the edited display glides smoothly instead of jumping\n- New Edit Block State screen for block displays (sneak-click -> Edit Block State): a button for every allowed value, or a slider for number properties, with a live preview\n- Copy and paste: Ctrl+C copies the selected display, Ctrl+V applies its rotation and scale (plus the block state, head texture and other options when the displays match)\n- Scrolling inside a menu no longer nudges the selected display"
		},
