			"notes": "## Changes\n- Text displays now accept tellraw-style text: plain text, or JSON/SNBT text components (colours, bold, italic, extra parts, ...)\n- New create/edit screen for text displays with background (on/off, RGB colour, opacity slider), shadow, alignment, billboard and text opacity slider; editing starts with the current values\n- Button to open the raw JSON text generator in your browser\n- Cycle Billboard for block and item displays in the quick menu\n- Text displays no longer have a depth scale handle and use a paper-thin selection box\n- Set Texture input starts with the head's current texture"
		},
